    "GHSA-vpq2-c234-7xj6": {
        "notes": "@tootallnate/once AbortSignal control flow (promise may never settle). Current tree includes vulnerable copies through a bundled runtime dependency (@deepnote/sql-language-server -> @google-cloud/bigquery -> teeny-request -> http-proxy-agent) and through other transitive paths including @vscode/test-electron and jsdom-related packages under @jupyterlab/filebrowser, so this is not strictly dev-only. An override to @tootallnate/once 3.0.1 installed and loaded in isolated smoke tests, but that remediation has not yet been adopted or validated in this repo.",
